<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Page Not Found ｜ 找不到頁面 | AMPINTEC PLUS</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <link rel="icon" href="{{ '/favicon.ico' | url }}" sizes="any">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="{{ '/apple-touch-icon.png' | url }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/css/style.css' | url }}">
  <style>
    .error-404-wrap {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background-color: var(--color-dark-bg);
      color: var(--color-white);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .error-404-wrap h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .error-404-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 28px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-404-wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>404</h1>
      <p>找不到您要瀏覽的頁面，該頁面可能已經移除或網址有誤。</p>
      <p>The page you are looking for could not be found. It may have been moved or the link may be incorrect.</p>
      <div class="error-404-links">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/zh/' | url }}">回首頁（中文）</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ '/en/' | url }}">Back to Homepage (English)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
